meta {
  name: (2-3) Set Current Tree to user tree
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{domain}}/trees/current
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
      "trees": [
          {
              "id": "{{treeId}}"
          }
      ]
  }
}

docs {
  The /trees/current endpoint sets or gets the currently selected tree. APIs called after setting the current tree will affect the current tree.
  
  POST /trees/current with a request body that provides a tree ID will set the current tree for the session.
  
  If the status code from this request is 204 Created, proceed to (2-4) Get Current Tree
}
